{
  "slug": "claude-telemetry",
  "name": "Claude Telemetry",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Customizable multi-line status line for Claude Code — real-time session telemetry in your terminal. Shows remaining context window, rate limit countdown, git status, session duration, cost tracking, and more. Supports preset modes (compact/normal/detailed), 4 languages (en/ko/ja/zh), color-coded thresholds, and progress bars. Single Go binary with sub-10ms rendering.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (3): `config` (Adjust Claude Code status line display (preset, sections, bar width)), `remove` (Remove Claude Code status line configuration), `setup` (Interactive setup for Claude Code status line)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-telemetry@claude-community` from `jeongph/claude-telemetry`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 3
  },
